  "design_notes": [
    "Section 7.2.3 is headed \"Mars lander (C7)\": every option lists C7 only.",
    "Table 5.1 gives C7 a \"1 t lander in aeroshell\"; the landers here weigh 0.6 t, 0.8 t and 1.0 t and the design defines no aeroshell or heat-shield vote for C7.",
    "Every landing method starts with a parachute, so every lander carries parachute_failure with the drop test of 6.6 as its mitigation (8.4: cause \"No drop test\"). This is inferred from the landing-method text; the table does not say it.",
    "MG-26 Seven Minutes of Terror is the C7 entry, descent and landing minigame, so every lander enables it; F20 is its fact.",
    "Qualitative cells are flags: bouncy_landing, engine_plume_dust, more_edl_steps, precise_landing, most_complex_edl_sequence. \"Precise\" has no landing-ellipse number.",
    "The table has no cost, reliability or maturity. Mass is tagged game_value (table 5.1 labels the payload a game value)."
  ],
